  ],

  it: [

    `Scopri ${locationLabel} attraverso questa esperienza immersiva in 4K. Il percorso mostra l'atmosfera delle strade, l'ambiente urbano e la vita quotidiana da una prospettiva autentica.`,

    `Old Towns Walks organizza questo contenuto per chi desidera esplorare virtualmente la zona, trovare idee di viaggio e scoprire video correlati. Fonte: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  fr: [

    `Découvrez ${locationLabel} grâce à cette expérience immersive en 4K. La visite présente l'ambiance des rues, l'environnement urbain et la vie quotidienne depuis une perspective réelle.`,

    `Old Towns Walks organise ce contenu pour les visiteurs souhaitant explorer la région virtuellement, trouver des idées de voyage et découvrir des vidéos associées. Source : ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  ja: [

    `${locationLabel}を4K映像で探索してください。街路の雰囲気、都市の景観、日常の様子をリアルな視点から楽しめます。`,

    `Old Towns Walksでは、地域をバーチャルに探索し、旅行のアイデアや関連動画を見つけられるよう、このコンテンツを整理しています。動画提供元: ${sourceName}。`

  ],

  pt: [

    `Explore ${locationLabel} através desta experiência imersiva em 4K. O passeio mostra a atmosfera das ruas, o ambiente urbano e a vida cotidiana.`,

    `Old Towns Walks organiza este conteúdo para quem deseja explorar a região virtualmente, encontrar ideias de viagem e descobrir vídeos relacionados. Fonte: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  ru: [

    `Исследуйте ${locationLabel} в формате 4K. Видео показывает атмосферу улиц, городское окружение и повседневную жизнь.`,

    `Old Towns Walks организует этот материал для тех, кто хочет виртуально познакомиться с районом и найти похожие видео. Источник: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  zh: [

    `通过这段4K视频探索${locationLabel}。内容展示当地街道氛围、城市环境和日常生活。`,

    `Old Towns Walks 整理此内容，帮助用户虚拟探索该地区并发现相关视频。视频来源：${sourceName}。`

  ],

  ko: [

    `4K 영상으로 ${locationLabel}을 탐험해 보세요. 거리 분위기와 도시 환경, 일상의 모습을 실제 시점에서 경험할 수 있습니다.`,

    `Old Towns Walks는 지역을 가상으로 둘러보고 관련 영상을 찾을 수 있도록 이 콘텐츠를 구성합니다. 영상 출처: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  ar: [

    `استكشف ${locationLabel} من خلال تجربة غامرة بدقة 4K. تعرض الجولة أجواء الشوارع والمشهد الحضري والحياة اليومية.`,

    `ينظم Old Towns Walks هذا المحتوى للزوار الذين يرغبون في استكشاف المنطقة افتراضيًا والعثور على فيديوهات مشابهة. المصدر: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  hi: [

    `${locationLabel} को इस 4K अनुभव के माध्यम से देखें। यह वीडियो सड़क के माहौल, शहरी परिवेश और रोज़मर्रा की जिंदगी को वास्तविक दृष्टिकोण से दिखाता है।`,

    `Old Towns Walks इस सामग्री को क्षेत्र को वर्चुअली देखने और संबंधित वीडियो खोजने वाले दर्शकों के लिए व्यवस्थित करता है। स्रोत: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  nl: [

    `Ontdek ${locationLabel} met deze meeslepende 4K-ervaring. De video toont de sfeer van de straten, de stedelijke omgeving en het dagelijkse leven.`,

    `Old Towns Walks organiseert deze content voor bezoekers die het gebied virtueel willen ontdekken en vergelijkbare video's willen vinden. Bron: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  pl: [

    `Odkryj ${locationLabel} dzięki temu doświadczeniu w jakości 4K. Film pokazuje atmosferę ulic, miejskie otoczenie i codzienne życie.`,

    `Old Towns Walks porządkuje ten materiał dla osób, które chcą wirtualnie odkrywać okolicę i znaleźć podobne filmy. Źródło: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  sv: [

    `Upptäck ${locationLabel} genom denna uppslukande 4K-upplevelse. Videon visar gatulivet, stadsmiljön och vardagen.`,

    `Old Towns Walks organiserar innehållet för besökare som vill utforska området virtuellt och hitta liknande videor. Källa: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  id: [

    `Jelajahi ${locationLabel} melalui pengalaman 4K yang imersif ini. Video menampilkan suasana jalan, lingkungan kota, dan kehidupan sehari-hari.`,

    `Old Towns Walks mengatur konten ini bagi pengunjung yang ingin menjelajahi kawasan secara virtual dan menemukan video terkait. Sumber: ${sourceName}.`

  ],

  vi: [

    `Khám phá ${locationLabel} qua trải nghiệm 4K sống động này. Video cho thấy bầu không khí đường phố, không gian đô thị và cuộc sống hằng ngày.`,

    `Old Towns Walks sắp xếp nội dung này cho những người muốn khám phá khu vực trực tuyến và tìm các video liên quan. Nguồn: ${sourceName}.`

  ]

};

const pageDescription =

  descriptions[currentLang] ||

  descriptions.en;

const metaDescription =

  pageDescription.join(' ').slice(0, 160);

---

<BaseLayout

  title={seoTitle}

  description={metaDescription}

>

  <div class="walk-page">

    <div class="page-top">

      <a

        href={`/${currentLang}/`}

        class="back-link"

      >

        ← {label('back')}

      </a>

      <h1>{seoTitle}</h1>

    </div>

    <div class="discovery-layout">

      

      <aside class="left-rail">

        <section class="side-module">

          <div class="module-icon">⌖</div>

          <div>

            <h2>{label('map')}</h2>

            <p>{label('planned')}</p>

          </div>

        </section>

        <section class="side-module">

          <div class="module-icon">⌂</div>

          <div>

            <h2>{label('hotels')}</h2>

            <p>{label('planned')}</p>

          </div>

        </section>

        

        <section

          class="ad-module"

          aria-label="Advertisement"

        ></section>

      </aside>

      

      <section class="video-column">

        <div class="video-frame">

          <iframe

            src={`https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/${video.id}`}

            title={seoTitle}

            loading="lazy"

            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"

            allowfullscreen

          ></iframe>

        </div>

        <div class="meta-row">

          {video.city && cityUrl && (

            <div class="meta-item">

              <span class="meta-label">

                {label('city')}

              </span>

              <a

                href={cityUrl}

                class="meta-value meta-link"

              >

                {video.city}

              </a>

            </div>

          )}

          {video.country && countryUrl && (

            <div class="meta-item">

              <span class="meta-label">

                {label('country')}

              </span>

              <a

                href={countryUrl}

                class="meta-value meta-link"

              >

                {video.country}

              </a>

            </div>

          )}

          {!video.city && !video.country && locationLabel && (

            <div class="meta-item">

              <span class="meta-label">

                {label('location')}

              </span>

              <span class="meta-value">

                {locationLabel}

              </span>

            </div>

          )}

          {video.category && (

            <div class="meta-item">

              <span class="meta-label">

                {label('category')}

              </span>

              <span class="meta-value">

                {categoryLabel}

              </span>

            </div>

          )}

          {video.badge && (

            <div class="meta-item">

              <span class="meta-label">

                {label('quality')}

              </span>

              <span class="meta-value">

                {video.badge}

              </span>

            </div>

          )}

          {(video.channelTitle || video.channel) && (

            <div class="meta-item">

              <span class="meta-label">

                {label('channel')}

              </span>

              <span class="meta-value">

                {sourceName}

              </span>

            </div>

          )}

        </div>

        <section class="description-card">

          <h2>{label('about')}</h2>

          <div class="description-content">

            {pageDescription.map((paragraph: string) => (

              <p>{paragraph}</p>

            ))}

          </div>

        </section>

      </section>

      

      <aside class="related-rail">

        <div class="related-heading">

          <div>

            <h2>{label('related')}</h2>

            <p>{categoryLabel}</p>

          </div>

          <span class="related-count">

            {relatedVideos.length}

          </span>

        </div>

        <div class="related-scroll">

          {relatedVideos.map((item) => (

            <a

              href={`/${currentLang}/walks/${item.id}`}

              class="related-card"

            >

              <div class="related-thumb">

                <img

                  src={

                    item.thumbnail ||

                    `https://i.ytimg.com/vi/${item.id}/hqdefault.jpg`

                  }

                  alt={getVideoCardTitle(item, currentLang)}

                  loading="lazy"

                />

                {item.badge && (

                  <span class="related-badge">

                    {item.badge}

                  </span>

                )}

              </div>

              <div class="related-info">

                <h3>

                  {getVideoCardTitle(item, currentLang)}

                </h3>

                <p>

                  {item.channelTitle || item.channel}

                </p>

              </div>

            </a>

          ))}

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

  </div>

  <script

    type="application/ld+json"

    set:html={JSON.stringify(videoSchema)}

  />

</BaseLayout>

<style>

  .walk-page {

    min-height: 100vh;

    background: #0d1117;

    color: #f5f7fa;

    padding: 24px 16px 60px;

  }

  .page-top {

    width: min(1660px, calc(100% - 24px));

    margin: 0 auto 16px;

  }

  .back-link {

    display: inline-flex;

    margin-bottom: 10px;

    color: #8993a1;

    font-size: 12px;

    font-weight: 600;

    transition: color .2s ease;

  }

  .back-link:hover {

    color: #ffffff;

  }

  .page-top h1 {

    margin: 0;

    color: #f8fafc;

    font-size: clamp(21px, 1.45vw, 26px);

    font-weight: 650;

    line-height: 1.25;

    letter-spacing: -0.02em;

  }

  .discovery-layout {

    width: min(1660px, calc(100% - 24px));

    margin: 0 auto;

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns:

      260px

      minmax(700px, 900px)

      390px;

    justify-content: center;

    gap: 20px;

    align-items: start;

  }

  

  .left-rail {

    display: flex;

    flex-direction: column;

    gap: 14px;

    position: sticky;

    top: 94px;

  }

